<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Good </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">morning/afternoon</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">I hope you are doing well.&nbsp; I am touching base to learn about new developments in your business that may impact your business goals that we had previously identified.&nbsp; As your needs change based on a range of factors, I'm here to explore how Insperity's services can best support you. I want to ensure we are providing the best resources for your specific requirements.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Your strategic partnership with Insperity offers access to a diverse range of teams that can assist you in growing your business.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><ul><li><font face="arial">Diversity Equity and Inclusion - this team assists clients in developing inclusive cultures as a business strategy.</font></li><li><font face="arial">Retirement Services - with these services, you can attract top talent by offering savings for retirement and other financial needs for your employees.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="arial">Performance Management - a web-based performance management system that enables managers and employees to track spending goals, complete performance reviews and manage and track performance notes throughout the year.</font></li></ul></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>This is a small sample of what Insperity offers in our partnership. I've attached a brochure to provider broader information about these fee inclusive resources. Are you free to speak on <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[insert date and time</span>] to talk more; I can offer specific details about the value of these offerings and how utilizing the full array of Insperity's services has helped many of my clients achieve success.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Thank you for allowing me the opportunity to support your business.<br>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
